                "en": "To calculate tax-inclusive price of products in cells A4 and A5 with 2 types of hypothetical consumption tax rates set in cells D2 and E2, what formula should be entered in cell D4. Here, formula entered in D4 will be copied and used for cells D5, E4, and E5."
